# Lab UI

- UI is English, light by default (clear neutral canvas), accessible, and explains the selected operation from registry metadata.
- Keep `originalImage` immutable until an explicit reset; processing writes only `processedImage`.
- Render parameter controls from the registry; do not duplicate server defaults, limits, or operation names.
- Parameter changes apply only when the user clicks Apply or Run comparison; do not auto-fire requests on slider movement.
- Surface API errors and timing visibly; do not hide failed processing behind stale output.
- Charts label axes, units, legends, and channel/color-space conventions.
